{"applicability_conditions":null,"identity":{"block_id":"b0081","equation_id":"equation_022","equation_number":"22","is_image":false,"latex_hint":"$$\nF _ {\\mathrm{r}} = \\frac {G b _ {\\mathrm{s}} ^ {2}}{2 (x _ {0} + x _ {\\mathrm{c}})} + \\frac {G b _ {\\mathrm{s}} ^ {2} \\cos (\\pi / 3)}{2 \\pi x _ {0}}\\tag{22}\n$$","paper_id":"10.1007_s11837-014-1032-x"},"latex":"F_{\\mathrm{r}} = \\frac{G b_{\\mathrm{s}}^{2}}{2(x_{0} + x_{\\mathrm{c}})} + \\frac{G b_{\\mathrm{s}}^{2} \\cos(\\pi/3)}{2\\pi x_{0}}","purpose":"计算两个 Shockley 分位错之间的排斥力 F_r；该力随后除以 b_s（式 23）用于求使两分位错靠近至孪晶核形成临界距离 x_c 所需的应力。","symbols":[{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"两个分位错之间的排斥力","symbol":"F_{\\mathrm{r}}","unit":null,"value":null},{"is_constant":true,"meaning":"剪切模量","symbol":"G","unit":null,"value":null},{"is_constant":true,"meaning":"Shockley 分位错的 Burgers 矢量大小","symbol":"b_{\\mathrm{s}}","unit":null,"value":"b/√3"},{"is_constant":true,"meaning":"完整位错的 Burgers 矢量大小","symbol":"b","unit":null,"value":null},{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"两个分位错之间的平衡间距","symbol":"x_{0}","unit":null,"value":null},{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"形成孪晶核所需的临界距离","symbol":"x_{\\mathrm{c}}","unit":null,"value":null},{"is_constant":true,"meaning":"余弦项中的角度，等于 60°","symbol":"\\pi/3","unit":null,"value":"cos(π/3) = 0.5"}],"unmapped":["x_0 由式(21)给出：x_0 = (G b_s/γ_sf)(b_s/8π)((2+v)/(1-v))，其中 γ_sf 为层错能、v 为泊松比。","式(23)为 τ_r = F_r/b_s，即该排斥力对应的应力；由该关系可推 F_r 具有单位长度力（N/m）量纲，但论文未明示单位。","分母中的系数 2 及第二项分母中的 π 在提供的上下文中未作解释。"]}